      "message": "fix(sim): march 256 steps and give an exact verdict at exhaustion\n\nThe stock preview march stopped after 64 steps. Over a flat face each\nstep is 0.9 x the height, so a ray at a few degrees ran out, got no\nverdict, and the composite showed the grid through the cut stock.\n\nBoth twins (march.rs and trace.wgsl) now take 256 steps. A ray that\nstill runs out gets a hit only where material is proved on the ray\n(the last sample, or the hit law's probe one cell on, is inside); a\nbisection of that bracket puts the hit within 1/64 cell. Every other\nexhausted ray keeps no verdict, so a near miss is never painted.\n\nPinned by a_grazing_faced_floor_resolves_and_stays_see_through.\n\nFixes #3612\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
